{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25551","headline":"感兴 · 李涉","name":"感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隋氏造宫阙，峨峨倚云烟。\n搜奇竭四海，立制谋千年。\n秦兵半夜来，烈火焚高台。\n万人聚筋血，一旦爲尘埃。\n君看汴河路，尚说隋家柳。\n但问哭陵人，秋草没来久。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}